    <briefdescription>
<para>Decorator applying median filtering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Median has no runtime parameters besides the template window size. This decorator does not own a heartbeat; it only transforms the value. Wrap it with <ref refid="classevam_1_1_sampled_decor" kindref="compound">SampledDecor</ref> to get periodic output: <verbatim>SampledDecor&lt;MedianDecor&lt;MyMotor, 5&gt;&gt; a;
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>TMotor</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Base motor class (must implement <ref refid="classevam_1_1_median_decor_1ac84f484527fb1982dcf56de3ae0f140c" kindref="member">Go(signed short)</ref>) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>tWindowSize</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Filter window size (odd number). Default: 5 </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
